═══ REGLAS ARQUITECTONICAS ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════

  [R01] NO usar frameworks en backend (ni Express, ni Fastify, etc.)
  [R02] NO usar librerias JS en frontend (ni React, ni Vue, ni Alpine)
  [R03] Tailwind CSS solo via CDN (no npm, no build step)
  [R04] SPA en index.html con todas las vistas embebidas, manejadas con
        classList.add/remove('view-hidden'/'view-active')
  [R05] API RESTful con JSON en todas las respuestas
  [R06] Autenticacion por Bearer token en header Authorization
  [R07] Sesiones expiran en 7 dias
  [R08] Contraseñas hasheadas con scrypt nativo de Node.js (salt:hash)
  [R09] Todas las queries SQL parametrizadas ($1, $2...) para evitar injection
  [R10] La UI debe permanecer 100% en espanol
  [R11] No modificar la estetica visual existente, solo la logica

═══ DIAGRAMA DE FLUJO (API) ═════════════════════════════════════════════════

  CLIENTE (SPA)                     SERVIDOR (Node.js)
  ─────────────                     ──────────────────
  fetch(/api/auth/register)   ──>  routes/auth.js  →  services/auth.js  →  db/queries.js
  fetch(/api/auth/login)      ──>  routes/auth.js  →  services/auth.js  →  db/queries.js
  fetch(/api/auth/me)         ──>  routes/auth.js  →  services/auth.js  →  db/queries.js
  fetch(/api/areas)           ──>  routes/areas.js →  db/queries.js
  fetch(/api/interview/start) ──>  routes/interview.js →  services/ai.js →  db/queries.js
  fetch(/api/interview/answer)──>  routes/interview.js →  services/ai.js →  db/queries.js
  fetch(/api/interview/finish)──>  routes/interview.js →  services/ai.js →  db/queries.js
  fetch(/api/history)         ──>  routes/history.js →  db/queries.js
  fetch(/api/dashboard/stats) ──>  routes/dashboard.js →  db/queries.js
  fetch(/api/user/profile)    ──>  routes/user.js →  services/auth.js →  db/queries.js

